Z||000000||Johnson's85SE||07-23-2001||04:25 PM||||Hey guys, need some input. I have an 1985SE V6 with a rebuilt bottom end. Nothing High performance just stock. No CAT. I have raced and beaten 90Z24's(3.1L), CRX's that have been souped (headers, exhaust, Intake). and even a 1995 Integra with headers, dual exhaust. The integra was the closest, and I only won by slightly pulling infront of him.(slight cut off) but victory. I now have three of my friends hounding me to race at race city. I have a 4 speed and dont like racing at 150KMs plus, I loose my acelleration in 4th gear. My three competitors are as follows. a 96civic hatchback with nitrous. A 99 Tibiron. and a 93 240 SX. The three of them have already raced, and the tibiron beat them all, followed by the civic, and  then the 240SX. The only person that has be talking this up is the guy with the 240SX. Should I Try to teach them a lesson? I thought a stock tibiron was only 140HP? I have an exhaust manifold leak on the my car, that I cant fix it till my friend gets his car back. (He's Driving my  Fiero)Suggestion's wanted please.     <P>------------------<BR>If it isn't broke, it's not my car.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Old Lar||07-23-2001||04:39 PM||||One bit of advice..Never drive to the track in the car you plan to race.   If something breaks......  Have someone bring a trailer tow bar, just to have the option to get home.<P>You are asking a lot for a 150K mile car.||||reg||1
